Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 大家好 - 菲比{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hi, guys. JOEY: Hey, Phoebe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}情况如何？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey, oh, how did it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不是太好{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Um, not so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他送我到地铁站 并且说〝我们该再这么做〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}He walked me to the subway and said, "We should do this again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么？他说〝我们该再这么做〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Ouch. - What? He said, "We should do it again."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是件好事吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's good, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，简单地翻译 〝我们该再这么做〞是指{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, no. Loosely translated, "We should do this again," means:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝你再也看不到我的裸体〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"You will never see me naked."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}从什么时候开始？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Since when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}一直都是这样，那是种约会语言{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Since always. It's, like, dating language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝那与你无关〞 意思是〝全都是你的错〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, like, "It's not you," means, "It is you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝你是个好人〞意思是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"You're such a nice guy," means:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝我要跟穿着皮衣的酒鬼约会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"I'm gonna be dating leather-wearing alcoholics...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟他们抱怨你的事〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and complaining about them to you."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝我想我们该跟别人交往看看〞 意思是指{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Or, you know, um, "I think we should see other people," means:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝我已经那么做了〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"Ha, ha, I already am."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}大家都知道这些事？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And everybody knows this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对，降低冲击力{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, yeah. Cushions the blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}像是你小的时候 爸妈将你的狗安乐死{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Like when you're a kid and your parents put your dog to sleep...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟你说他逃跑到农场去了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and they tell you it went off to live on some farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那真的很好笑 不，因为我们的爸妈真的…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's funny. No, because, uh, our parents actually did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}把我们的狗送到农场去{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...uh, send our dog off to live on a farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}康涅狄格州的麦纳农场？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha, ha. Hello. The Milner's farm in Connecticut?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.92,0:01:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}麦纳夫妇有座超棒的农场{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The Milners, they had this unbelievable farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们养了马跟兔子 他可以追着他们玩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They had horses and rabbits that he could chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And it was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊，奇奇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God. Chi-Chi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:24.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs22\bord1\shad1\fsp1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《老友记》  第一季  第3集  见友弃色{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Friends S01E03: The One with the Thumb{\r}
