Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.37,0:01:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：丽莎·库卓）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马特·勒布朗）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：马修·派瑞）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（主演：大卫·修蒙）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}〝知道自己快死掉时 那是什么样的感觉？〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"So how does it feel knowing you're about to die?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（制片：塔德·史帝文斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.45,0:02:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}典狱长，五分钟后我将不再痛苦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Warden, in five minutes my pain will be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:25.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但你得一辈子受到良心谴责 知道自己送一个诚实的人去死{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But you'll have to live with the knowledge that you sent an honest man to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.08,0:02:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 那真的很不错 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Hey, that was really good. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：杰佛瑞·艾斯多夫  麦克·西考维兹）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 对 - 谢了 继续吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Yeah. - Thanks. Let's keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.55,0:02:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧， 你要我怎么做？迪蒙{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. "So, what do you want from me, Dimon? Huh?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我只想回我的牢房 因为在我的牢房里，我能抽烟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I just wanna go back to my cell, because in my cell, I can smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你就抽吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"Smoke away."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：詹姆斯·柏洛斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.03,0:03:00.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想这是迪蒙 独自在牢房抽烟的原因{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I think this is probably why Dimon smokes in his cell alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 什么？ - 手放轻松{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- What? - Relax your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}手腕下垂{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Let your wrist go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 别垂得那么低  - 哇{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Not so much.  - Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}嘿{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，试着抽一口{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. Now try taking a puff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.01,0:03:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 好吧，不，快给我 - 不，我才不要给你烟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- Okay, no, give it to me. - No, no, no. I'm not giving you a cigarette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没关系的，听着 你要不要这个角色？来吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, it's fine. It's fine. Look, do you want to get this part or not? Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，别当这是香烟{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. Now, don't think of it as a cigarette.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}当它是从你手里不见的东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Think of it as the thing that has been missing from your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}拿着它，你觉得安心{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}When you're holding it, you feel right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}- 你觉得圆满 - 你想念它吗？{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}- You feel complete. - You miss it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.86,0:03:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不，不是很想{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, not so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧，现在抽一口{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. Now we smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:03:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（中央咖啡厅）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs20\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们说那个的长度 跟男人拇指尖{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs12\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They say it's the same as the distance from the tip of a guy's thumb...{\r}
